{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-index-js","path":"/","result":{"data":{"hero":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Hi, my name is","name":"Md. Tariqul Islam","subtitle":"Chasing the click, wherever it leads.","buttonText":"Contact Me"},"html":"<p>A mountain, a football field, a line of code; different terrain, same instinct: chasing the moment everything clicks into place. Lately that instinct is pulling me toward public service, chasing the same click in something built for people, not just for code.</p>"}}]},"about":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"avatar":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":0.7510729613733905,"src":"/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/cb825/pro-pic-2.jpg","srcSet":"/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/e95b4/pro-pic-2.jpg 175w,\n/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/6d118/pro-pic-2.jpg 350w,\n/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/cb825/pro-pic-2.jpg 700w,\n/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/21cf1/pro-pic-2.jpg 864w","srcWebp":"/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/1a99d/pro-pic-2.webp","srcSetWebp":"/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/7b8d3/pro-pic-2.webp 175w,\n/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/696d0/pro-pic-2.webp 350w,\n/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/1a99d/pro-pic-2.webp 700w,\n/static/b5fd5ba1601f5b0f9a26d2496de695ef/e17da/pro-pic-2.webp 864w","sizes":"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px"}}}},"html":"<p>I'm an AI researcher and engineer with over five years of experience building Large Language Models (LLMs), Speech AI and Text-to-Speech (TTS) systems. I earned my bachelor's degree from Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology. My research spans Natural Language Processing, Computer Vision and Signal Processing, resulting in one patent and seven(7) publications, including a paper published in a Springer journal. Throughout my industry career, I've delivered AI solutions for government and enterprise clients across Bangladesh, Japan and India, and have been recognized with multiple Best Performer awards, contributed to open-source AI initiatives and earned top positions in international IEEE AI competitions.</p>\n<p>I've recently been recommended for the BCS Customs and Excise Cadre as an Assistant Commissioner, marking the start of my journey in public service. My mission is to build a modern, technology-driven customs administration — integrating AI, analytics and digital governance to strengthen revenue collection, safeguard Bangladesh's economic interests, facilitate legitimate trade and combat illicit trade.</p>\n<p>Here is a list of the technologies that I'm familiar with!</p>"}}]},"awards":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"4th at IEEE SP CUP 2020","location":"ICASSP 2020, BARCELONA","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":1.9021739130434783,"src":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/87dd3/sp_cup_2020.png","srcSet":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/5418a/sp_cup_2020.png 175w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/a8f78/sp_cup_2020.png 350w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/87dd3/sp_cup_2020.png 700w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/da960/sp_cup_2020.png 1050w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/1b043/sp_cup_2020.png 1251w","srcWebp":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/1a99d/sp_cup_2020.webp","srcSetWebp":"/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/7b8d3/sp_cup_2020.webp 175w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/696d0/sp_cup_2020.webp 350w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/1a99d/sp_cup_2020.webp 700w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/c41d1/sp_cup_2020.webp 1050w,\n/static/7bff69cd953ef26e5e4ded96a076ba10/98e8e/sp_cup_2020.webp 1251w","sizes":"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px"}}}}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"2nd at IEEE VIP CUP 2019","location":"ICIP 2019, TAIWAN","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1.78571428